# The generated type maps: one machine-written declaration file per EnergyPlus
# version, 2.5 MB each. Prettier is not the author here, and letting it be one
# puts `npm run codegen` and `npm run format` permanently at odds — regenerate,
# and format:check fails until someone reformats 5 MB of text nobody reads. The
# generator's output is the canonical form. Everything else in these packages,
# manifest and README included, is checked normally.
packages/types-*/index.d.ts
